  clickhouse (Rust client)  MIT OR Apache-2.0  https://github.com/ClickHouse/clickhouse-rs
  time                   MIT OR Apache-2.0  https://github.com/time-rs/time
  serde (direct use)     MIT OR Apache-2.0  https://github.com/serde-rs/serde
  libfuzzer-sys (fuzz-only, own workspace, never shipped)  MIT OR Apache-2.0 (REQUIRES VERIFICATION)  https://github.com/rust-fuzz/libfuzzer

Starting Phase 5B-1 (crates/incident-postgres, dependency probe only —
no schema, no migration, no adapter implementation yet), the following
